Site popularity
---------------

Site popularity ordering uses the Chrome UX Report by Google, licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://developer.chrome.com/docs/crux), via
https://github.com/zakird/crux-top-lists. The origins were reduced to host
names, filtered and hashed.


